s & Textures)",3,6,"Every text ZacUI draws is in the one font chosen on Appearance > Fonts & Textures. Size, outline and shadow are set here."},{"r","Size",3,6},{"r","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,6},{"r","Outline",3,6},{"r","Shadow",3,6},{"r","Outline",3,6},{"r","Shadow X",3,6},{"r","29m 4m 12",3,6},{"r","Shadow Y",3,6},{"r","Where it sits",3,6},{"r","Bottom edge",3,6},{"r","Every buff and debuff",3,6},{"r","Dark sweep as it runs out",3,6},{"r","Nudge across",3,6},{"r","Nudge up",3,6},{"t","Reset",3,6,"Back to where it sits by default."},{"r","Position",3,6},{"r","Reset",3,6},{"r","Of the target",3,6},{"r","Anchor to",3,6},{"r","Point",3,6},{"r","The icon",3,6},{"r","Y offset",3,6},{"r","X offset",3,6},{"r","Text align",3,6},{"t","Text align",3,6,"Automatic, left, center or right. Automatic lines the text up with the point it hangs from."},{"r","Automatic",3,6},{"d","Automatic",3,6,"Any corner of the icon or the button, or next to the other text. Reset goes back to the spot above."},{"c","Stack count",3,7},{"r","Count font",3,7},{"r","Font",3,7},{"t","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,7,"Every text ZacUI draws is in the one font chosen on Appearance > Fonts & Textures. Size, outline and shadow are set here."},{"r","Size",3,7},{"r","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,7},{"r","Outline",3,7},{"r","Shadow",3,7},{"r","Outline",3,7},{"r","Shadow X",3,7},{"r","Shadow Y",3,7},{"r","Count colour",3,7},{"r","Corner",3,7},{"r","Bottom right",3,7},{"r","Nudge across",3,7},{"r","Nudge up",3,7},{"t","Reset",3,7,"Back to where it sits by default."},{"r","Position",3,7},{"r","Reset",3,7},{"r","Of the target",3,7},{"r","Anchor to",3,7},{"r","Point",3,7},{"r","The icon",3,7},{"r","Y offset",3,7},{"r","X offset",3,7},{"r","Text align",3,7},{"t","Text align",3,7,"Automatic, left, center or right. Automatic lines the text up with the point it hangs from."},{"r","Automatic",3,7},{"d","Automatic",3,7,"Any corner of the icon or the button, or next to the other text. Reset goes back to the spot above."},{"c","Running out",4,8},{"r","When a buff is about to run out",4,8},{"r","Style",4,8},{"r","None",4,8},{"r","Duration",4,8},{"r","Delay",4,8},{"r","Easing",4,8},{"t","Repeat until hidden",4,8,"Pulse and Flash only: keep playing for as long as the frame is shown."},{"r","Repeat until hidden",4,8},{"r","Smooth",4,8},{"r","Comes from",4,8},{"r","Distance",4,8},{"r","Above",4,8},{"d","Above",4,8,"Plays on the time left once it drops under the 'about to run out' line (Look tab), and repeats until the buff is refreshed or gone. None is how it has always been."},{"c","Rows",5,9},{"t","Rows",5,9,"Blizzard wraps buffs to the width worked out once from the gap beside the minimap, so a moved buff frame piles its icons into a narrow block. Zero leaves Blizzard's wrapping alone; Edit Mode's Icon Limit is the same setting."},{"r","Buffs per row",5,9},{"d","Buffs per row",5,9,"Blizzard wraps buffs to the width worked out once from the gap beside the minimap, so a moved buff frame piles its icons into a narrow block."},{"r","Blizzard's (Edit Mode)",5,9},{"r","Grow across",5,9},{"r","New rows",5,9},{"r","Blizzard's (Edit Mode)",5,9},{"c","Where they sit",5,10},{"r","Move buffs",5,10},{"r","Reset",5,10},{"c","Reset",6,11},{"t","Reset the look",6,11,"Every setting on this page except buffs per row and the consolidation switch."},{"r","Reset the look",6,11},{"b","General",1,0},{"b","Look",2,0},{"b","Text",3,0},{"b","Animation",4,0},{"b","Position",5,0},{"b","Advanced",6,0}},t={{"general","General"},{"look","Look"},{"text","Text"},{"anim","Animation"},{"pos","Position"},{"adv","Advanced"}}}]=],
[=[return {c={"Options","The website's new address, a raid timer that waits for the pull, and Oil of Immolation on the swing timer"},e={{"c","Options",0,1},{"t","Mark as seen",0,1,"Stops marking these versions as new."},{"r","Open in a window",0,1},{"r","Mark as seen",0,1},{"r","Show what's new after an update",0,1},{"d","Show what's new after an update",0,1,"Opens this list once, a few seconds after the first login on a new version."},{"r","Show all versions",0,1},{"r","Off: only what is new since you last looked (or the latest version).",0,1},{"c","The website's new address, a raid timer that waits for the pull, and Oil of Immolation on the swing timer",0,2},{"r","v3.0.21 2026-11-27",0,2},{"r","Changed",0,2},{"d","Changed",0,2,"The website has a new address: zacaddons.com. The report, suggest and website buttons, and /zui report and /zui suggest, now open it."},{"r","Fixed",0,2},{"d","Fixed",0,2,"Raid timer: a buff or ability used before the pull (a Bloodrage, say) started the clock early. It now starts at the first hit on an enemy."},{"d","Fixed",0,2,"Swing timer: using Oil of Immolation starts your swing over, and the swing bar now shows that."}},t={}}]=],
[=[return {c={"The bar","What the bar shows","Tabs","Typing","In a raid","Chat history","Streaming privacy cover","Links in the chat","When the chat shows","Icon rail","Bar buttons","Panel","Bar","Edit box","Panel texture and border","Tab names","Polish","Chat","Tab names on their tabs","What each line says","Time stamps","Tabs on mouseover","Something new","Old messages","Whispers","Where you type","Size and spot","Size","Tools"},e={{"c","The bar",1,1},{"t","Show the bar under the chat",1,1,"A strip along the bottom of the chat panel: channel buttons on the left, the numbers you tick below on the right. It belongs to the docked chat - General and every tab docked with it - and windows you have dragged out do not get one."},{"r","Show the bar under the chat",1,1},{"d","Show the bar under the chat",1,1,"A strip along the bottom of the chat panel: channel buttons on the left, the numbers you tick below on the right."},{"t","Channel buttons",1,1,"S, P, R, RW and G, each in that channel's own colour and only while you can talk there. Click one to start typing in it."},{"r","Channel buttons",1,1},{"d","Channel buttons",1,1,"S, P, R, RW and G, each in that channel's own colour and only while you can talk there."},{"t","Whisper counter",1,1,"A W button that counts whispers since you last answered one. Hover for the last few, click to reply to the most recent, right-click to clear the count."},{"r","Whisper counter",1,1},{"r","A W button that counts whispers since you last answered one.",1,1},{"t","Jump to latest",1,1,"ZacUI hides Blizzard's scroll buttons, so when you are scrolled up a Latest button appears on the bar. Click it to drop back to the newest message."},{"r","Jump to latest",1,1},{"d","Jump to latest",1,1,"ZacUI hides Blizzard's scroll buttons, so when you are scrolled up a Latest button appears on the bar."},{"c","What the bar shows",1,2},{"t","What the bar shows",1,2,"In the order they sit on the bar, left to right. When the chat is too narrow for all of them, the bar fits the most urgent first - durability, then bag space, then gold - and leaves off whatever there is no room for."},{"r","In the order they sit on the bar, left to right.",1,2},{"t","Group size",1,2,"Raid or party size, only while you are in one. Hover for loot method, threshold, and who is offline or dead."},{"r","Group size",1,2},{"r","Raid or party size, only while you are in one.",1,2},{"r","Guild members online",1,2},{"r","Hover for who is on and where; click for the roster.",1,2},{"t","Friends online",1,2,"Battle.net friends included. Hover for who and where; click for the list."},{"r","Friends online",1,2},{"r","Battle.net friends included.",1,2},{"r","Coordinates",1,2},{"r","Blank inside instances, which report no position.",1,2},{"t","Free bag slots",1,2,"Free slots in your ordinary bags (quivers, soul bags and profession bags are left out). Orange at three, red when full. Click opens your bags."},{"r","Free bag slots",1,2},{"d","Free bag slots",1,2,"Free slots in your ordinary bags (quivers, soul bags and profession bags are left out)."},{"t","Durability",1,2,"Your most worn piece. Orange at 50%, red at 20%. Hover for every slot."},{"r","Durability",1,2},{"r","Your most worn piece.",1,2},{"r","Gold",1,2},{"d","Gold",1,2,"Hover for the exact amount and what you have made or spent since logging in."},{"r","Frames per second",1,2},{"r","Orange under 40, red under 20.",1,2},{"r","Latency",1,2},{"r","The worse of home and world latency. Hover for both.",1,2},{"t","Clock",1,2,"Realm time, or local time if Blizzard's clock is set to it. The minimap has one too, so this starts off."},{"r","Clock",1,2},{"r","Realm time, or local time if Blizzard's clock is set to it.",1,2},{"c","Tabs",1,3},{"t","Style the chat tabs",1,3,"The tab you are on gets a raised chip with a line under it, a tab with something new pulses its line, and the one under the mouse lights faintly. Off leaves them as bare words."},{"r","Style the chat tabs",1,3},{"d","Style the chat tabs",1,3,"The tab you are on gets a raised chip with a line under it, a tab with something new pulses its line, and the one under the mouse lights faintly."},{"t","Put the docked tabs on a strip",1,3,"A header strip on top of the chat panel, behind General and everything docked with it. It shows and hides with the tabs. Sized from where the tabs actually are; if it ever sits wrong, /zui chatinfo prints the measurements."},{"r","Put the docked tabs on a strip",1,3},{"d","Put the docked tabs on a strip",1,3,"A header strip on top of the chat panel, behind General and everything docked with it."},{"t","When the tabs show",1,3,"With the mouse over the chat, the tabs (and their strip) are hidden until the cursor is on the chat, its tab row or the bar, then fade in - and a tab with something new shows either way. Blizzard's dimming is the game's own: faint when the mouse is away, never gone."},{"r","Only with the mouse over the chat",1,3},{"r","When the tabs show",1,3},{"d","When the tabs show",1,3,"With the mouse over the chat, the tabs (and their strip) are hidden until the cursor is on the chat, its tab row or the bar, then fade in - and a tab with something new shows either way."},{"c","Typing",1,4},{"t","Arrow keys without Alt",1,4,"Up and down recall what you typed before, left and right move through the text. Off is Blizzard's way: hold Alt."},{"r","Arrow keys without Alt",1,4},{"d","Arrow keys without Alt",1,4,"Up and down recall what you typed before, left and right move through the text."},{"c","In a raid",1,5},{"t","Raid frames in the chat box",1,5,"In a raid the chat box holds the raid frames, fitted to its size, and the messages move to a strip you can hide. Leaving the raid gives the box back. Same as /zacui raidchat."},{"r","Raid frames in the chat box",1,5},{"d","Raid frames in the chat box",1,5,"In a raid the chat box holds the raid frames, fitted to its size, and the messages move to a strip you can hide."},{"t","Party frames in the chat box too",1,5,"While the raid frames are in the chat box, a 5-man party sits there too, in one row across the top. Off keeps the party frames where you put them."},{"r","Party frames in the chat box too",1,5},{"d","Party frames in the chat box too",1,5,"While the raid frames are in the chat box, a 5-man party sits there too, in one row across the top."},{"t","Raid timer on the raid strip",1,5,"While the raid frames hold the chat box: a clock from the first pull, and each boss kill against the same kill on your best full clear with the same Readycheck raid config. Hover it for every split."},{"r","Raid timer on the raid strip",1,5},{"d","Raid timer on the raid strip",1,5,"While the raid frames hold the chat box: a clock from the first pull, and each boss kill against the same kill on your best full clear with the same Readycheck raid config."},{"t","The clock starts at",1,5,"A fight that ends with nothing killed - running past trash to get into position - does not start the clock, and the clock counts from that fight's first blow: being in combat before the pull (Bloodrage, a potion) adds nothing. The other choice starts it the moment you are first in combat."},{"r","The first fight with a kill, or a boss pull",1,5},{"r","The clock starts at",1,5},{"d","The clock starts at",1,5,"A fight that ends with nothing killed - running past trash to get into position - does not start the clock, and the clock counts from that fight's first blow: being in combat before the pull (Bloodrage, a potion) adds nothing."},{"r","Raid timer clock",1,5},{"r","Times",1,5},{"r","Tenths below (0 = never)",1,5},{"r","Default (1:05)",1,5},{"r","Before it",1,5},{"r","Letters",1,5},{"r","Default",1,5},{"r","After it",1,5},{"r","Reads: 23:45 1:02:03",1,5},{"c","Chat history",1,6},{"t","Keep the chat across /reload",1,6,"The last lines of every chat window are saved when you log out or reload and come back when you log in, so a /reload mid-raid does not wipe what was said. The combat log is never kept. While the privacy cover is on, whispers are not brought back and guild lines come back masked."},{"r","Keep the chat across /reload",1,6},{"r","Lines per window",1,6},{"r","Dimmed",1,6},{"r","Restored lines look",1,6},{"r","Dimmed to",1,6},{"t","Preview",1,6,"Puts three made-up lines into the chat window you are looking at, dressed the way saved lines come back."},{"r","Preview",1,6},{"d","Preview",1,6,"Dimmed lines keep their channel colour, darker. The time stamp is the time of the reload or logout they were saved at."},{"c","Streaming privacy cover",1,7},{"t","Mask guild, officer and whisper text",1,7,"Those lines show as \"[Guild] Name: ••••••\" in every chat window, so a stream never shows them. Only what the chat draws changes: what you type and send is never touched. Also /zui privacy and a key binding (Key Bindings > ZacUI chat)."},{"r","Mask guild, officer and whisper text",1,7},{"t","Your own replies too",1,7,"\"To Healbot: ...\" lines - what you whispered back - are masked as well."},{"r","Your own replies too",1,7},{"t","Show the PRIVACY ON tag",1,7,"A small tag at the right end of the chat's tab strip while the cover is on. Movable (Movers)."},{"r","Show the PRIVACY ON tag",1,7},{"t","Clear the chat windows when it goes on",1,7,"Lines already on screen are not masked after the fact; this wipes them instead."},{"r","Clear the chat windows when it goes on",1,7},{"r","PRIVACY ON",1,7},{"r","the tag, as it looks",1,7},{"r","Tag font",1,7},{"r","Font",1,7},{"t","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",1,7,"Every text ZacUI draws is in the one font chosen on Appearance > Fonts & Textures. Size, outline and shadow are set here."},{"r","Size",1,7},{"r","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",1,7},{"r","Outline",1,7},{"r","Shadow",1,7},{"r","Outline",1,7},{"r","Shadow X",1,7},{"r","PRIVACY ON",1,7},{"r","Shadow Y",1,7},{"r","Tag colour",1,7},{"r","Reset",1,7},{"r","Move the tag",1,7},{"d","Move the tag",1,7,"The whisper button, its glow and the whisper sound keep working; only the words are hidden."},{"c","Links in the chat",1,8},{"t","Make web addresses clickable",1,8,"\"https://...\" and \"www....\" in what people say become a link in the colour below. Click one and a box opens with the address selected: Ctrl+C copies it. Lines already in the chat stay as they were."},{"r","Make web addresses clickable",1,8},{"t","Reset",1,8,"Back to the theme colour."},{"r","Link colour",1,8},{"r","Sample: see [https://wow.gg]",1,8},{"t","Test",1,8,"Puts a line with an address in it into the chat window you are looking at; click the address to see the box."},{"r","Test",1,8},{"t","Show a link's tooltip on hover",1,8,"Item, spell, quest, talent, achievement and enchant links in the chat show their tooltip at the cursor while the mouse is over them. A click still opens them as before."},{"r","Show a link's tooltip on hover",1,8},{"r","What you type and send is never changed; only what the chat shows.",1,8},{"c","When the chat shows",1,9},{"t","Fade the whole chat when it is idle",1,9,"After the time below with nobody talking, no typing and no mouse over it, the chat - text, panel, tabs and bar - dims. It comes back the moment a player says something, a whisper arrives, you start typing or the mouse comes over it. NPC lines do not wake it."},{"r","Fade the whole chat when it is idle",1,9},{"r","Idle for",1,9},{"r","Fade by",1,9},{"t","Trade and world channels wake it too",1,9,"Off: General, Trade and the other numbered channels keep it asleep, so a busy city does not hold the chat up."},{"r","Trade and world channels wake it too",1,9},{"t","Test",1,9,"Fades the chat now, as if it had been idle; move the mouse over it to wake it."},{"r","Test",1,9},{"d","Test",1,9,"At 100% the chat is gone and the mouse passes through it to what is underneath."},{"r","Show the chat",1,9},{"r","Opacity",1,9},{"r","Show",1,9},{"r","Default (Always)",1,9},{"r","Opacity in combat",1,9},{"d","Opacity in combat",1,9,"Default is always, at full. \"Never\" hides it completely and the mouse passes through; the idle fade, when on, dims it further still."},{"c","Icon rail",1,10},{"t","Show the icon rail",1,10,"A column of icons beside the chat panel: friends online, copy chat, these settings, and a button back to the newest line while you are scrolled up. Right-click the rail to switch icons."},{"r","Show the icon rail",1,10},{"t","Only while the mouse is over the chat",1,10,"On: the icons fade in when you mouse over the chat or the icons, and fade out after. Off: they always show."},{"r","Only while the mouse is over the chat",1,10},{"r","Friends",1,10},{"r","Guild",1,10},{"r","Durability",1,10},{"r","Copy chat",1,10},{"r","Swap chat and raid frames",1,10},{"r","Raid messages on / off",1,10},{"r","Raid frames in the chat box (on / off)",1,10},{"r","Chat settings",1,10},{"r","Scroll to the newest line",1,10},{"t","Side",1,10,"Icons that do not fit the chat's height are left off from the bottom of the list. Friends, guild, character and channels open out of combat only (they are the game's own windows)."},{"r","Side",1,10},{"r","Left (right when there is no room)",1,10},{"d","Left (right when there is no room)",1,10,"Icons that do not fit the chat's height are left off from the bottom of the list."},{"c","Bar buttons",1,11},{"t","A chat settings button (a cog)",1,11,"A cog at the right end of the bar that opens this page."},{"r","A chat settings button (a cog)",1,11},{"d","A chat settings button (a cog)",1,11,"Once on, they are in \"What the bar shows\" with the rest and step off first when the bar is narrow."},{"c","Panel",2,12},{"r","Background opacity",2,12},{"r","The dark panel behind the messages. The bar stays solid.",2,12},{"r","Background colour",2,12},{"r","Edge",2,12},{"c","Bar",2,13},{"r","Bar height",2,13},{"r","Bar colour",2,13},{"r","Line along its top",2,13},{"c","Tabs",2,3},{"r","Tab you are on",2,3},{"r","Its chip; the tab under the mouse gets the same colour, fainter.",2,3},{"r","Line under it",2,3},{"r","Also the line that pulses on a tab with something new.",2,3},{"r","Line thickness",2,3},{"r","Strip colour",2,3},{"r","Strip's bottom line",2,3},{"c","Edit box",2,14},{"r","Height",2,14},{"r","Under or above the panel; in the bar it is as tall as the bar.",2,14},{"r","Colour the edit box by channel",2,14},{"d","Colour the edit box by channel",2,14,"The box's edge takes the colour of the channel you are about to talk in, so a message headed for the wrong one is visible before you press Enter."},{"c","Panel texture and border",2,15},{"r","Panel texture",2,15},{"r","Flat (as before)",2,15},{"r","Border size",2,15},{"r","Border colour",2,15},{"r","The palette / the colour picked",2,15},{"r","A thin line inside the border",2,15},{"t","Reset",2,15,"Back to the theme colour."},{"r","Inner line colour",2,15},{"d","Inner line colour",2,15,"Shown on the preview above. On the Classic look the edge is the game's art and keeps its own size."},{"c","Tab names",2,16},{"t","Reset",2,16,"Back to the theme colour."},{"t","Reset",2,16,"Back to the theme colour."},{"r","The other tabs",2,16},{"r","The tab you are on",2,16},{"r","Chip padding across",2,16},{"t","Chip padding across",2,16,"Blank colours: white (65% on the other tabs) under ZacUI's look, the game's own under the others. Where the tabs sit along the strip stays the game's."},{"r","Chip padding up and down",2,16},{"d","Chip padding up and down",2,16,"Blank colours: white (65% on the other tabs) under ZacUI's look, the game's own under the others."},{"c","Polish",2,17},{"t","Polished chat styling",2,17,"A deep blue-black panel with faint 1 px edges, the strip behind the tabs in the panel's colour, tab names in ZacUI's font in white, a 1 px underline, ZacUI's font outlined on messages and the edit box, and ZacUI's resize grip. Colours and fonts you pick still win. Nothing moves."},{"r","Polished chat styling",2,17},{"t","Tabs as tiles",2,17,"Each tab a tile as wide as the tab, the strip as tall as it takes to centre the names. The strip's height changes; off keeps today's layout."},{"r","Tabs as tiles",2,17},{"t","Indent wrapped lines",2,17,"A message too long for one line carries on under its first words rather than at the chat's edge, so where each message starts is easy to see."},{"r","Indent wrapped lines",2,17},{"c","Bar",3,13},{"r","Buttons and numbers",3,13},{"r","Font",3,13},{"t","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,13,"Every text ZacUI draws is in the one font chosen on Appearance > Fonts & Textures. Size, outline and shadow are set here."},{"r","Size",3,13},{"r","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,13},{"r","Outline",3,13},{"r","Shadow",3,13},{"r","Outline",3,13},{"r","Shadow X",3,13},{"r","S G W 2 Bags 23 | 98% | 412g",3,13},{"r","Shadow Y",3,13},{"c","Chat",3,18},{"r","Messages",3,18},{"r","Font",3,18},{"t","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,18,"Every text ZacUI draws is in the one font chosen on Appearance > Fonts & Textures. Size, outline and shadow are set here."},{"r","Size",3,18},{"r","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,18},{"r","Outline",3,18},{"r","Shadow",3,18},{"r","None",3,18},{"r","Shadow X",3,18},{"r","[Guild] [Zaccw]: pulling in 10",3,18},{"r","Shadow Y",3,18},{"d","Shadow Y",3,18,"Each chat window keeps the size you give it in Blizzard's own chat menu unless you set one here."},{"r","Tab names",3,18},{"r","Font",3,18},{"t","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,18,"Every text ZacUI draws is in the one font chosen on Appearance > Fonts & Textures. Size, outline and shadow are set here."},{"r","Size",3,18},{"r","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,18},{"r","Outline",3,18},{"r","Shadow",3,18},{"r","None",3,18},{"r","Shadow X",3,18},{"r","General Combat Log Whispers",3,18},{"r","Shadow Y",3,18},{"r","Edit box",3,18},{"r","Font",3,18},{"t","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,18,"Every text ZacUI draws is in the one font chosen on Appearance > Fonts & Textures. Size, outline and shadow are set here."},{"r","Size",3,18},{"r","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)