in chat window at the width below."},{"r","Chat width",6,27},{"c","Size",6,28},{"t","Lock the chat's size",6,28,"The resize grip in the chat's corner stops working (and is not drawn), so the chat cannot be resized by a stray drag. Moving it is the game's own Lock Window, on the tab's right-click menu."},{"r","Lock the chat's size",6,28},{"c","Tools",7,29},{"t","Copy chat",7,29,"Opens the tab you are looking at as plain text you can select and copy. Also on the bar's right-click menu, and /zui copychat."},{"t","Reset",7,29,"Puts every option on this page back to the default."},{"t","Diagnose",7,29,"Prints what each chat window, edit box and bar item is doing on this client. /zui chatinfo does the same."},{"r","Diagnose",7,29},{"r","Copy chat",7,29},{"r","Reset",7,29},{"b","General",1,0},{"b","Look",2,0},{"b","Text",3,0},{"b","Animation",4,0},{"b","Sound",5,0},{"b","Position",6,0},{"b","Advanced",7,0}},t={{"general","General"},{"look","Look"},{"text","Text"},{"anim","Animation"},{"sound","Sound"},{"pos","Position"},{"adv","Advanced"}}}]=],
