nts, Chi, Soul Shards, runes, Essence, Arcane Charges). No swing timers, five-second rule or mana ticks, and nothing is read off the target's debuffs in a fight."},{"t","Class HUDs, Drink Ticker and Hesitation alerts (the part) - Classic Era",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"t","Class HUDs, Drink Ticker and Hesitation alerts (the part) - Forever",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"t","Class HUDs, Drink Ticker and Hesitation alerts (the part) - TBC",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"r","on",0,2},{"r","on",0,2},{"r","on",0,2},{"r","changed",0,2},{"r","Warrior HUD",0,2},{"t","Warrior HUD - TBC",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"t","Warrior HUD - Classic Era",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"t","Warrior HUD - Retail",0,2,"Can't run there: the Classic warrior rotation (Bloodthirst, Sunder, Overpower, swing timers) is not Retail's; Retail's own class HUD takes its place. It does not load on this game: no frames, settings or search hits; your settings for it are kept."},{"t","Warrior HUD - Forever",0,2,"Runs, changed: swing timers come from the game's own swing event; the Overpower window comes from the game's Overpower button; in combat the execute cue asks the game's own health curve (Forever hides enemy health, casts and auras from addons in combat), and Hamstring's timer shows as the game hands it over while its name reads."},{"r","changed",0,2},{"r","on",0,2},{"r","on",0,2},{"r","can't",0,2},{"d","can't",0,2,"Class HUDs (Paladin, Priest, Hunter, Rogue, Shaman, Mage, Warlock, Druid)"},{"t","Class HUDs (Paladin, Priest, Hunter, Rogue, Shaman, Mage, Warlock, Druid) - Classic Era",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"t","Class HUDs (Paladin, Priest, Hunter, Rogue, Shaman, Mage, Warlock, Druid) - Retail",0,2,"Can't run there: the Classic class rotations and items (mana gems, runes, Classic potions) are not Retail's; Retail's own class HUD (every class, from the game's Cooldown Manager) takes their place. It does not load on this game: no frames, settings or search hits; your settings for it are kept."},{"t","Class HUDs (Paladin, Priest, Hunter, Rogue, Shaman, Mage, Warlock, Druid) - Forever",0,2,"Runs, changed: swing and Auto Shot bars come from the game's own swing event; your target debuffs show in combat with their timers and stacks as the game hands them over (Forever hides them from addons in combat; ZacUI hands them straight to the display); ones whose names are hidden too fill the row in the game's order, past the per-debuff ticks."},{"t","Class HUDs (Paladin, Priest, Hunter, Rogue, Shaman, Mage, Warlock, Druid) - TBC",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"r","can't",0,2},{"r","changed",0,2},{"r","on",0,2},{"r","on",0,2},{"r","Swing timers on the HUDs",0,2},{"t","Swing timers on the HUDs - TBC",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"t","Swing timers on the HUDs - Classic Era",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"t","Swing timers on the HUDs - Retail",0,2,"Can't run there: Retail has neither the combat log nor Forever's swing event for addons to time swings by. It does not load on this game: no frames, settings or search hits; your settings for it are kept."},{"t","Swing timers on the HUDs - Forever",0,2,"Runs, changed: from the game's own swing event (PLAYER_SWING) instead of the combat log: each swing restarts its bar at the game's swing time and a parry of yours speeds the next (Warrior HUD); a speed change mid-swing is not stretched while the game hides your attack speed."},{"r","changed",0,2},{"r","on",0,2},{"r","on",0,2},{"r","can't",0,2},{"r","Drink Ticker",0,2},{"t","Drink Ticker - Classic Era",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"t","Drink Ticker - TBC",0,2,"Runs as it does on Classic Era."},{"t","Drink Ticker - Retail",0,2,"Not needed there: Retail's mana regenerates steadily, not in the two-second ticks the Drink Ticker shows. It does not load on this game: no frames, settings or search hits; your settings for it are kept."},{"t","Drink Ticker - Forever",0,2,"Runs,