[=[return {c={"Getting started","Look","Setup, hints and reset","Need help?","At a glance","Updates","This window","Quick actions","Voice","Slash commands","Panel calibration","Reset"},e={{"c","Getting started",0,1},{"d","Getting started",0,1,"New here? The tour shows you around this window. Quick setup picks your look and the parts you want, then reloads once."},{"t","Take the tour",0,1,"Walks you around this window, one part at a time. /zui tour does the same."},{"t","Quick setup",0,1,"Your look and which parts are on, in three steps, with one reload. /zui setup does the same."},{"r","Quick setup",0,1},{"r","Take the tour",0,1},{"t","Show the setup at login",0,1,"The first-time setup opens by itself at your next login."},{"r","Show the setup at login",0,1},{"c","Look",0,2},{"r","The world wears the ZacUI look.",0,2},{"r","Open Style",0,2},{"c","Setup, hints and reset",0,3},{"t","Setup, hints and reset",0,3,"The setup runs again any time with your current look and parts. One-time hints are the tips ZacUI shows once; Reset hints brings them (and the setup at login) back. Reset ZacUI starts over from a fresh install: every ZacUI setting is cleared and every game setting ZacUI changed goes back."},{"r","The setup runs again any time with your current look and parts.",0,3},{"t","Reset ZacUI",0,3,"Clears every ZacUI setting (account-wide and this character's: positions, colours, profiles, everything) and puts back every game setting ZacUI changed (interface scale, nameplate and screen effect settings and the rest), then reloads into a fresh install. ZacUI stays on. /zui reset all does the same."},{"t","Run the setup",0,3,"Your look and parts, in three steps. /zui setup does the same."},{"t","Reset hints",0,3,"Every one-time tip shows again, and the setup comes back at your next login. /zui hints reset does the same."},{"r","Reset hints",0,3},{"r","Run the setup",0,3},{"r","Reset ZacUI",0,3},{"c","Need help?",0,4},{"t","Need help?",0,4,"Message Zac on Discord: Zac12. Something broken, or something missing? The other two buttons give you a link to the site's form, already filled in with your version."},{"r","Message Zac on Discord: Zac12.",0,4},{"t","Discord",0,4,"Shows Zac's Discord name selected, ready for Ctrl+C."},{"t","Report a problem",0,4,"A link to copy into your browser. /zui report does the same."},{"r","Report a problem",0,4},{"r","Discord",0,4},{"t","Suggest a feature",0,4,"A link to copy into your browser. /zui suggest does the same."},{"r","Suggest a feature",0,4},{"c","At a glance",0,5},{"r","Version",0,5},{"r","75 of 76",0,5},{"r","Modules on",0,5},{"r","Frames skinned this session",0,5},{"c","Updates",0,6},{"t","Tell me when a newer ZacUI is out",0,6,"ZacUI compares versions with your guild and group in the background. When someone has a newer one, one line in chat says so, once a session. Your version is still shared while this is off. /zacui version shows the newest one seen."},{"r","Tell me when a newer ZacUI is out",0,6},{"r","One line in chat, once a session. Update with the CurseForge app.",0,6},{"c","This window",0,7},{"r","Opacity",0,7},{"t","In a fight",0,7,"Fade it out: down to a quarter until the fight ends. The - beside the window scale folds it to a small badge any time."},{"r","Stay as it is",0,7},{"r","In a fight",0,7},{"r","Fade it out: down to a quarter until the fight ends.",0,7},{"c","Quick actions",0,8},{"t","Reload UI",0,8,"Some changes - anything that strips Blizzard artwork - can only be undone by reloading."},{"t","Rescan frames",0,8,"Walk every frame alive right now through the classifier. Safe to repeat - already-skinned frames are skipped."},{"t","Identify a frame",0,8,"Arms /zacui id. The next thing you click prints its name and type in chat - useful when reporting something that skinned badly."},{"r","Reload UI",0,8},{"r","Identify a frame",0,8},{"r","Rescan frames",0,8},{"d","Rescan frames",0,8,"Identify prints the name, type and parent of the next frame you click. That name is what /za