[=[return {c={"Alert","Big alert","Nameplate row","Every HUD: bars","Every HUD: icons","Every HUD: polish","Big alert text","Where the alert's texts sit","HUD text","Where the icon texts sit","Where the bar numbers sit","Motion","Icons in the HUD rows","Cooldown ready","The alert's icon","This session","Fight log","Reset"},e={{"c","Alert",1,1},{"t","Alert",1,1,"In combat, each watched ability is checked ten times a second: off cooldown, enough rage (and the right stance), a living enemy target in range. Once that has been true for the grace time and you still have not pressed it, the alert shows until you do. Time on the global cooldown never counts and never resets the clock - pressing other buttons is not hesitation - and nothing new is raised while you are on it. Every press is timed; the late ones are summed up when combat ends."},{"d","Alert",1,1,"In combat, each watched ability is checked ten times a second: off cooldown, enough rage (and the right stance), a living enemy target in range."},{"r","Enable hesitation alerts",1,1},{"c","Big alert",2,2},{"r","Alert size",2,2},{"r","Alert text",2,2},{"r","Time ready text",2,2},{"r","Background",2,2},{"r","Edge",2,2},{"d","Edge",2,2,"Until you pick one, each colour follows ZacUI's palette (Appearance > Colours)."},{"c","Nameplate row",2,3},{"r","Icon size",2,3},{"r","A NOOB icon keeps growing while you ignore it",2,3},{"r","...up to",2,3},{"r","Press it (gold)",2,3},{"r","The NOOB glow",2,3},{"r","Ready, no rage",2,3},{"c","Every HUD: bars",2,4},{"d","Every HUD: bars",2,4,"Shared by every class HUD, the Drink Ticker and Hesitation's nameplate row."},{"r","Bar texture",2,4},{"r","ZacUI's texture",2,4},{"r","Bar background",2,4},{"r","Bar border",2,4},{"r","Bar border thickness",2,4},{"c","Every HUD: icons",2,5},{"r","Icon border",2,5},{"r","Icon background",2,5},{"r","Icon border thickness",2,5},{"r","Cooldown swipe",2,5},{"r","The dark sweep over an icon while it is on cooldown.",2,5},{"t","The dark sweep over an ico