,{"r","Dips to",4,22},{"r","Lower is darker.",4,22},{"c","The wheel's zoom",4,23},{"r","Ease the wheel's zoom",4,23},{"r","Each wheel step glides to the next level instead of snapping.",4,23},{"r","Glide time",4,23},{"r","A wheel step into a new zone glides a little longer.",4,23},{"c","The window",5,12},{"t","The window",5,12,"The seamless map's own window is in charge while it is loaded: drag its title bar and pull its corners instead. These apply when the ZacUI World map part is switched off."},{"d","The window",5,12,"The seamless map's own window is in charge while it is loaded: drag its title bar and pull its corners instead."},{"t","Unlocked",5,12,"Drag the header to move the map, and the grip in the bottom right corner to size it. The map frame itself never takes the mouse, so clicks always reach the map underneath."},{"r","Unlocked",5,12},{"d","Unlocked",5,12,"Drag the header to move the map, and the grip in the bottom right corner to size it."},{"t","Unlocked",5,12,"Scales the whole window, the way ElvUI does. The grip in the bottom right corner does the same thing by hand."},{"r","Size",5,12},{"r","Scales the whole window, the way ElvUI does.",5,12},{"t","Reset position",5,12,"Puts the map back in the middle of the screen at its default size."},{"r","Reset position",5,12},{"c","Battleground map",6,24},{"t","Take over the battleground map",6,24,"The small map that appears in a battleground. Blizzard's tab for it is hidden, since a movable map does not need one."},{"r","Take over the battleground map",6,24},{"r","The small map that appears in a battleground.",6,24},{"r","Unlocked",6,24},{"r","Drag just outside its edge to move it; the corner grip sizes it.",6,24},{"r","Width",6,24},{"r","Opacity",6,24},{"r","Allow zooming in further",6,24},{"r","Keep it centred on you",6,24},{"r","Hold shift to pan away.",6,24},{"r","Your arrow",6,24},{"r","Group icons",6,24},{"r","The preview's Battleground button shows it.",6,24},{"c","On the map",7,25},{"t","Find me",7,25,"Glide the map to where you stand."},{"t","Pins",7,25,"Every map pin: go to one, share them, import a code."},{"t","Drop a pin",7,25,"Then click the map to place a pin, with a note if you like. Ctrl-click the map does it any time."},{"t","Report a spot",7,25,"Draw on the map where something looks wrong and copy the report."},{"t","Draw",7,25,"Ink on the map: lines, arrows, rings and raid marks, kept for you."},{"r","Draw",7,25},{"r","Report a spot",7,25},{"r","Pins",7,25},{"r","Drop a pin",7,25},{"r","Find me",7,25},{"t","Credits",7,25,"Who made the map engine."},{"r","Credits",7,25},{"c","Seamless map",7,26},{"t","The seamless map",7,26,"Blizzard's world map with every zone stitched together: scroll out of a zone into the next, drag across the whole world. The quest log, the map's controls and Questie all keep working. Wheel zooms at the cursor, drag pans, left-click zooms into the place under the cursor, right-click zooms out a level. If you use Leatrix Maps or another world map addon, turn it off."},{"r","The seamless map",7,26},{"d","The seamless map",7,26,"Blizzard's world map with every zone stitched together: scroll out of a zone into the next, drag across the whole world."},{"r","What's new",7,26},{"r","Reset sliders to defaults",7,26},{"r","Load the zone in view",7,26},{"r","Highlight the zone under the cursor",7,26},{"r","When reopening the map",7,26},{"r","Center on player",7,26},{"c","Look",7,27},{"r","Colour matching",7,27},{"r","Take colour out",7,27},{"r","Unexplored areas",7,27},{"r","Show",7,27},{"r","Darkening",7,27},{"r","Filled gaps",7,27},{"r","Responsive ocean & border",7,27},{"r","Deepest zoom",7,27},{"r","Map size",7,27},{"r","Reset size and place",7,27},{"r","Full-screen map fills the width",7,27},{"r","Chat over the full-screen map",7,27},{"r","Minimap button",7,27},{"r","ZacUI Map button on the map",7,27},{"c","Icons",7,28},{"r","Dungeon level ranges",7,28},{"r","Dungeons and raids",7,28},{"r","Dungeon maps: quests",7,28},{"r","Dungeon maps: bosses",7,28},{"r","Dungeon quests from",7,28},{"r","The first installed",7,28},{"r","Clicking a dungeon entrance opens",7,28},{"r","Its map",7,28},{"r","Boats",7,28},{"r","Zeppelins",7,28},{"r","Flight masters",7,28},{"r","Only places you've found",7,28},{"r","Your arrow",7,28},{"r","Icons from zoom",7,28},{"r","Icon size",7,28},{"r","Quests from every zone",7,28},{"r","Boat and zeppelin routes",7,28},{"r","Party and raid members",7,28},{"r","Pins others share with you",7,28},{"r","Your drawings",7,28},{"c","On the map",7,25},{"r","Coordinates",7,25},{"r","Zone levels",7,25},{"r","Other addons' icons rest while zooming",7,25},{"r","Fade while moving",7,25},{"r","Map frame rate cap",7,25},{"c","Up close",7,29},{"r","Minimap detail",7,29},{"r","Minimap strength",7,29},{"r","Minimap detail from zoom",7,29},{"r","Minimap detail, most opacity",7,29},{"r","Minimap detail in major cities",7,29},{"r","Minimap in the gaps (experimental)",7,29},{"r","Soften and add paper grain",7,29},{"r","Caves and dungeon entrances",7,29},{"c","When something looks wrong",8,30},{"t","Diagnose",8,30,"Prints what loaded, what did not, and how much reveal data exists for the zone you are looking at."},{"r","Diagnose",8,30},{"d","Diagnose",8,30,"The same as /zui maps: what loaded, what did not, and why a category of pins shows nothing."},{"c","Reset",8,31},{"t","Reset the look",8,31,"Every colour, font, pin and dot detail and timing on this page back to how ZacUI ships it. What shows, where the map sits and the battleground map are left alone."},{"r","Reset the look",8,31},{"r","Colours go back to following the theme, fonts to ZacUI's font.",8,31},{"b","General",1,0},{"b","Look",2,0},{"b","Text",3,0},{"b","Animation",4,0},{"b","Position",5,0},{"b","Battleground",6,0},{"b","World map",7,0},{"b","Advanced",8,0}},t={{"general","General"},{"look","Look"},{"text","Text"},{"anim","Animation"},{"pos","Position"},{"bg","Battleground"},{"worldmap","World map"},{"adv","Advanced"}}}]=],
[=[return {c={"Windows","When the windows show","Updates","Segments","Threat","Raid summary","Report","Rows","Bar colours","Row states","Row background","Row border","Icons","Window","Header","Breakdown","Threat rows","Raid summary colours","Names","Numbers","Title and label","Label","Window 1 (threat)","Window 2 (meter)","Window 3 (meter)","Windows together","Order and length","Class icon on the rows","Role icon on the threat rows","Threat window","Look","Data"},e={{"c","Windows",1,1},{"t","Windows",1,1,"Window 1 is your threat window (bottom center), window 2 the current-fight damage window (bottom right, locked), window 3 the overall stacked above it - every boss and every trash pull of the night, updating live during a fight. A fresh install shows window 2 only; the others are a tick away below. Unlock to drag anywhere on the rows and resize from the bottom-right corner; the hover toolbar's first icon also locks and unlocks. Mouse wheel over any window scrolls the list."},{"d","Windows",1,1,"Window 1 is your threat window (bottom center), window 2 the current-fight damage window (bottom right, locked), window 3 the overall stacked above it - every boss and every trash pull of the night, updating live during a fight."},{"r","Show window 1 (threat)",1,1},{"r","Show window 2 (meter)",1,1},{"r","Window 2 shows",1,1},{"r","Damage Done",1,1},{"r","Window 2's fight",1,1},{"r","Current fight",1,1},{"r","Close window 2",1,1},{"r","Show window 3 (meter)",1,1},{"r","Damage Done",1,1},{"r","Window 3 shows",1,1},{"r","Overall",1,1},{"r","Window 3's fight",1,1},{"r","Close window 3",1,1},{"t","Add a window",1,1,"Up to 5 windows, each with its own mode and fight. They open and close at once; the + and x in a window's header do the same. Locking, size, scale and place are on the Position tab."},{"r","Add a window",1,1},{"r","Up to 5 windows, each with its own mode and fight.",1,1},{"c","When the windows show",1,2},{"r","Opacity",1,2},{"r","Show",1,2},{"r","Default",1,2},{"r","Opacity in combat",1,2},{"r","Brighten on mouseover",1,2},{"r","Fade in",1,2},{"r","Opacity on mouseover",1,2},{"r","Fade out",1,2},{"d","Fade out",1,2,"Hidden windows only fade out: they still take clicks and keep counting."},{"c","Updates",1,3},{"t","Updates",1,3,"Seconds between window refreshes. The parser always records everything."},{"r","Update interval",1,3},{"r","Seconds between window refreshes.",1,3},{"c","Segments",1,4},{"t","Segments",1,4,"How many past fights the segment browser holds. Data lives in memory and clears on logout, like a fresh Details session."},{"r","Fights kept",1,4},{"r","How many past fights the segment browser holds.",1,4},{"r","Minimum fight length",1,4},{"r","Fights shorter than this are discarded.",1,4},{"r","Reset overall on a new raid boss",1,4},{"d","Reset overall on a new raid boss",1,4,"The overall segment wipes when you pull a raid boss you have not seen this session."},{"r","Ask before the reset icon wipes the data",1,4},{"d","Ask before the reset icon wipes the data",1,4,"The reset icon in a window's header (and the Reset meter data key) ask first."},{"c","Threat",1,5},{"t","Threat",1,5,"Seconds between scans of the whole group. Your own row, the tank's and \"You pull at\" follow new threat at once. TinyThreat ran 1.0."},{"r","Scan interval",1,5},{"r","Seconds between scans of the whole group.",1,5},{"t","Absolute mode",1,5,"Sort by raw threat instead of percent, with the ranged (130%) and melee (110%) pull thresholds. Yours was off - relative mode, 100% pulls."},{"r","Absolute mode",1,5},{"d","Absolute mode",1,5,"Sort by raw threat instead of percent, with the ranged (130%) and melee (110%) pull thresholds."},{"r","Hide the 'You pull at' bar",1,5},{"r","Raid: only my group",1,5},{"r","Show party pets",1,5},{"t","Make my row stand out",1,5,"How your own row is told apart on the threat list. The preview above shows it."},{"r","Make my row stand out",1,5},{"r","Off",1,5},{"r","How your own row is told apart on the threat list.",1,5},{"r","Colour of my row",1,5},{"t","Warn me before I pull threat",1,5,"On the boss you are fighting, when you are not the one tanking it: \"Threat\" once as you get within 10% of the level below, then \"Stop\" with a red warning on screen (showing your %) at that level. One word each, so it is said at once. Quiet for the first few seconds of a fight. Warriors hear these only in Berserker Stance."},{"r","Warn me before I pull threat",1,5},{"d","Warn me before I pull threat",1,5,"On the boss you are fighting, when you are not the one tanking it: \"Threat\" once as you get within 10% of the level below, then \"Stop\" with a red warning on screen (showing your %) at that level."},{"r","Stop warning at",1,5},{"t","Keep saying it while I stay that high",1,5,"\"Stop\" again every 3 seconds until you drop under it."},{"r","Keep saying it while I stay that high",1,5},{"t","Red warning in the middle of the screen",1,5,"The stop and aggro calls also show as a raid warning, with its sound."},{"r","Red warning in the middle of the screen",1,5},{"t","Tell me when I pull aggro",1,5,"\"Aggro\" once when a boss turns on you (not in Defensive Stance)."},{"r","Tell me when I pull aggro",1,5},{"t","Also in dungeons and parties",1,5,"Every threat warning here (the voice, the red line, the glow, the weak opener and the pull warning) runs in raids. Tick this to have them in 5-man groups and dungeons too."},{"r","Also in dungeons and parties",1,5},{"t","Also on trash",1,5,"The threat warnings run on bosses only. Tick this to have them on trash and other mobs too."},{"r","Also on trash",1,5},{"t","Warn me about a weak tank opener",1,5,"In the first seconds of a pull on an elite or a boss: if at the rates you and the tank are building threat you would pull within the time below, \"WEAK TANK OPENER\" in the middle of the screen with the raid-warning sound, \"Weak opener, hold\" said once, and the edges glow orange. Once per pull. On for warriors to begin with."},{"r","Warn me about a weak tank opener",1,5},{"r","When I would pull within",1,5},{"t","Warn me a few seconds before I pull",1,5,"Later in a fight, while you would pull within 3 seconds at the rates you and the tank are going: \"PULLING IN 3s\" in the middle of the screen, again every 3 seconds while it holds. On for warriors to begin with."},{"r","Warn me a few seconds before I pull",1,5},{"t","Glow round the screen as I near a pull",1,5,"A faint orange glow at the edges of the screen from the first level (or a pull within the opener's time), red and pulsing from the second (or a pull 3 seconds away), quicker the closer it gets, and a solid red flash when a mob turns on you. Like the voice it stays quiet for the first seconds of a fight (a weak opener aside) and never shows while you tank on purpose: a warrior sees it in every stance but Defensive. On for warriors to begin with."},{"r","Glow round the screen as I near a pull",1,5},{"r","Starts at",1,5},{"r","Turns red at",1,5},{"r","Strength",1,5},{"r","Edge width",1,5},{"r","Warning colour",1,5},{"r","Danger colour",1,5},{"t","Preview the glow at",1,5,"Not saved. Shows the preview's Threat glow at this threat; all the way right is a mob that just turned on you."},{"r","Preview the glow at",1,5},{"c","Raid summary",1,6},{"r","Collect a summary of each raid",1,6},{"d","Collect a summary of each raid",1,6,"Your damage and ranks (raid and class), each boss, your abilities next to the rest of your class, what hit you hardest, your deaths and the hesitation numbers - for the whole raid."},{"t","Open it when the last boss dies",1,6,"Ragnaros, Onyxia, Nefarian, Hakkar, Ossirian, C'Thun, Kel'Thuzad. /zui raid opens it any time."},{"r","Open it when the last boss dies",1,6},{"r","Ragnaros, Onyxia, Nefarian, Hakkar, Ossirian, C'Thun, Kel'Thuzad.",1,6},{"r","Show an example",1,6},{"r","Open the last raid summary",1,6},{"d","Open the last raid summary",1,6,"Its colours are on the Look tab; the preview's Raid summary button shows the example."},{"c",