[=[return {c={"What to show","On mouseover","Zoom","Group names","Markers on the minimap","ZacUI's button","Map","Pills (map only)","Markers","Map text","Panel texts (panel look)","Where things go (map only)","Fine placement (map only)","Corner icons","Size and spot","Tools","Button tray","Collecting","Where it sits","Look","Button layout","The bar","Opening and closing"},e={{"c","What to show",1,1},{"t","Zone name",1,1,"The header above the map (or its pill on the map-only look). Hiding it does not affect the zone text anywhere else."},{"r","Zone name",1,1},{"r","The header above the map (or its pill on the map-only look).",1,1},{"t","Clock",1,1,"The middle of the footer (or its pill). Click it for Blizzard's alarm and stopwatch. Arrives with Blizzard's time manager, which loads on demand - so this may take a moment to apply the first time."},{"r","Clock",1,1},{"r","The middle of the footer (or its pill).",1,1},{"t","Friends and guild",1,1,"Either side of the clock (or their pills): how many friends (Battle.net included) and guild members are online. Hover for who and where; click to open the list."},{"r","Friends and guild",1,1},{"d","Friends and guild",1,1,"Either side of the clock (or their pills): how many friends (Battle.net included) and guild members are online."},{"t","Coordinates",1,1,"Your position along the bottom edge of the map (or its pill). Blank inside instances, which report no position."},{"r","Coordinates",1,1},{"r","Your position along the bottom edge of the map (or its pill).",1,1},{"t","New mail envelope",1,1,"Top-left corner. Only ever visible when you have mail waiting."},{"r","New mail envelope",1,1},{"r","Top-left corner.",1,1},{"t","Tracking icon",1,1,"Bottom-left corner: the tracking spell you have on (Find Herbs, Find Minerals, a hunter track). Right-click it to turn tracking off."},{"r","Tracking icon",1,1},{"d","Tracking icon",1,1,"Bottom-left corner: the tracking spell you have on (Find Herbs, Find Minerals, a hunter track)."},{"c","On mouseover",1,2},{"d","On mouseover",1,2,"Map only. Ticked pieces wait until your mouse is over the map; unticked ones stay up all the time."},{"r","Zone name",1,2},{"r","Coordinates",1,2},{"r","Friends and guild",1,2},{"r","Clock",1,2},{"c","Zoom",1,3},{"r","Zoom with the mouse wheel",1,3},{"d","Zoom with the mouse wheel",1,3,"ZacUI hides Blizzard's + and - buttons because the wheel replaces them, so turning this off leaves no way to zoom at all."},{"r","... easing between the zoom levels",1,3},{"d","... easing between the zoom levels",1,3,"The map has six fixed zoom steps; this grows or shrinks the picture over a sixth of a second across each step instead of snapping."},{"t","... and on out into the map",1,3,"Past the game's widest level the wheel keeps going a little further, up to three times as wide: the live minimap shrinks in the middle and the zone's map paints in round it at the same scale. Not with a rotating minimap."},{"r","... and on out into the map",1,3},{"d","... and on out into the map",1,3,"Past the game's widest level the wheel keeps going a little further, up to three times as wide: the live minimap shrinks in the middle and the zone's map paints in round it at the same scale."},{"r","Zoom back out on its own",1,3},{"d","Zoom back out on its own",1,3,"Fifteen seconds after you last zoomed in, the map returns to fully zoomed out."},{"c","Group names",1,4},{"t","Names over your group's dots",1,4,"Each party or raid member's name in their class colour, just above their dot. Out in the world only: inside dungeons and raids the game does not tell addons where anyone is, so there it is just the dots."},{"r","Names over your group's dots",1,4},{"d","Names over your group's dots",1,4,"Each party or raid member's name in their class colour, just above their dot."},{"r","Leave off names that would overlap",1,4},{"c","Markers on the minimap",1,5},{"t","Markers on the minimap",1,5,"The same icons the world map uses, drawn where they are relative to you. Nothing here takes the mouse, so they cannot eat a click meant for the map underneath."},{"d","Markers on the minimap",1,5,"The same icons the world map uses, drawn where they are relative to you."},{"t","Show markers",1,5,"Off by default. Placing these needs a map position turned into yards and yards turned into pixels, and none of that can be checked outside the game - it shipped on once and put markers in fixed spots rather than real ones. Turn it on and run /zui minimapinfo: it prints each marker's distance and offset so you can see whether they line up."},{"r","Show markers",1,5},{"d","Show markers",1,5,"Off by default. Placing these needs a map position turned into yards and yards turned into pixels, and none of that can be checked outside the game - it shipped on once and put markers in fixed spots rather than real ones."},{"r","Flight paths, boats and zeppelins",1,5},{"r","Yours only - the other faction's are on the world map page.",1,5},{"r","Graveyards",1,5},{"r","Dungeon and raid entrances",1,5},{"r","Zone crossings",1,5},{"d","Zone crossings",1,5,"If you see none at all, /zui minimapinfo says why - most often nothing of yours is inside the minimap's current zoom."},{"c","ZacUI's button",1,6},{"t","Show the ZacUI minimap button",1,6,"Left-click opens the settings, right-click is a menu of pages, profiles, Edit Mode and the aura engine. A proper LibDBIcon button, so HidingBar, MBB and the button tray all collect it like any other."},{"r","Show the ZacUI minimap button",1,6},{"d","Show the ZacUI minimap button",1,6,"Left-click opens the settings, right-click is a menu of pages, profiles, Edit Mode and the aura engine."},{"r","Lock it in place",1,6},{"t","Hide the aura engine's own button",1,6,"The embedded engine (or WeakAuras, when that is the one running) puts a second button on the minimap. ZacUI's menu opens the same editor, so it is hidden by default."},{"r","Hide the aura engine's own button",1,6},{"d","Hide the aura engine's own button",1,6,"The embedded engine (or WeakAuras, when that is the one running) puts a second button on the minimap."},{"c","Map",2,7},{"r","Layout",2,7},{"t","Map only, details on the map",2,7,"Panel: the zone name in a strip above the map and friends, clock and guild in a strip below it. Map only: each of those sits on the map in a small pill, where you put it on the Position tab, and can wait for your mouse."},{"r","Map only, details on the map",2,7},{"d","Map only, details on the map",2,7,"Panel: the zone name in a strip above the map and friends, clock and guild in a strip below it."},{"t","Map only, details on the map",2,7,"The map itself, grown down and to the left from its top-right corner. Size on the Position tab scales everything, text included."},{"r","Map size",2,7},{"r","The map itself, grown down and to the left from its top-right corner.",2,7},{"r","Outline",2,7},{"r","Outline thickness",2,7},{"r","Light up the edge",2,7},{"r","A ring around the map while the mouse is over it (map only).",2,7},{"r","Ring colour",2,7},{"r","Zone name colour",2,7},{"r","By PvP status (Blizzard's colours)",2,7},{"c","Pills (map only)",2,8},{"r","What each piece sits on",2,8},{"t","Soft shadow",2,8,"The backing behind the zone name, clock, coordinates, friends and guild. Pick one, or change anything below to make your own."},{"r","Soft shadow",2,8},{"d","Soft shadow",2,8,"The backing behind the zone name, clock, coordinates, friends and guild."},{"r","Shape",2,8},{"r","A soft shadow",2,8},{"t","A soft shadow",2,8,"How dark the backing behind each piece of text is. Lower lets more of the map show through."},{"r","Pill darkness",2,8},{"r","How dark the backing behind each piece of text is.",2,8},{"r","Pill colour",2,8},{"r","Outline the text",2,8},{"d","Outline the text",2,8,"A dark edge on the pieces' text whatever the font is set to: for text with no box behind it."},{"r","Darken the map's top and bottom edges",2,8},{"d","Darken the map's top and bottom edges",2,8,"A soft dark band along the top and the bottom of the map for the pieces to sit on."},{"r","The mail and tracking icons wear it too",2,8},{"r","Off, the two corner icons keep their own dark box and edge.",2,8},{"c","Markers",2,9},{"r","Marker size",2,9},{"c","Map text",3,10},{"r","Zone name, clock, coordinates, friends and guild",3,10},{"r","Font",3,10},{"t","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,10,"Every text ZacUI draws is in the one font chosen on Appearance > Fonts & Textures. Size, outline and shadow are set here."},{"r","Size",3,10},{"r","Uses ZacUI's font (Fonts & Textures)",3,10},{"r","Outline",3,10},{"r","Shadow",3,10},{"r","Outline",3,10},{"r","Shadow X",3,10},{"r","Elwynn Forest 9:41",3,10},{"r","Shadow Y",3,10},{"d","Shadow Y",3,10,"The size is the map-only look's (the panel keeps its own small sizes); the font, outline and shadow are both looks'."},{"r","Coordinates",3,10},{"r","Decimals",3,10},{"r","Letters",3,10},{"r","Default",3,10},{"r","Before it",3,10},{"r","After it",3,10},{"r","Template",3,10},{"r","Reads: 42.1, 65.3",3,10},{"c","Panel texts (panel look)",3,11},{"r","Zone name",3,11},{"r","Text",3,11},{"t","Reset",3,11,"Back to where it sits by default."},{"r","Position",3,11},{"r","Reset",3,11},{"r","Anchor to",3,11},{"r","Of the target",3,11},{"r","Point",3,11},{"r","The zone strip",3,11},{"r","Y offset",3,11},{"r","X offset",3,11},{"r","Text align",3,11},{"t","Text align",3,11,"Automatic, left, center or right. Automatic lines the text up with the point it hangs from."},{"r","Automatic (center)",3,11},{"r","Only on the panel look (Look tab); the map-only look keeps its pills.",3,11},{"c","Group names",3,4},{"r","Name size",3,4},{"c","On mouseover",4,2},{"t","On mouseover",4,2,"How long the pieces that wait for the mouse take to fade in and out. Zero is instant. Replay in the preview plays it."},{"r","Fade time",4,2},{"r","How long the pieces that wait for the mouse take to fade in and out.",4,2},{"c","Where things go (map only)",5,12},{"t","Where things go (map only)",5