warnings, icons and lists with sample values - wherever you are, no fight needed - and unlocks a drag handle on every anchor and group. Drag the handles where you want things (the content follows), then stop the preview to lock them and clear the samples. Sample timers run round and round."},{"d","Preview and move",1,1,"Shows one raid's timers, warnings, icons and lists with sample values - wherever you are, no fight needed - and unlocks a drag handle on every anchor and group."},{"r","Molten Core",1,1},{"r","Which raid to preview.",1,1},{"r","Preview Molten Core",1,1},{"r","Reset anchors to pack positions",1,1},{"c","Raid mods",1,2},{"t","Raid mods",1,2,"Boss mods for Molten Core, Blackwing Lair, Zul'Gurub, Temple of Ahn'Qiraj and Naxxramas, as part of ZacUI: timers, warnings, icons, lists, marks on raid frames and nameplates, driven by the combat log. All of it is ZacUI's own addon code - nothing here is an aura, and the aura engine can stay off."},{"d","Raid mods",1,2,"Boss mods for Molten Core, Blackwing Lair, Zul'Gurub, Temple of Ahn'Qiraj and Naxxramas, as part of ZacUI: timers, warnings, icons, lists, marks on raid frames and nameplates, driven by the combat log."},{"t","Sounds and voice",1,2,"Every alert sound and every spoken warning the packs play. Off also silences the text-to-speech lines."},{"r","Sounds and voice",1,2},{"r","Enable raid mods",1,2},{"r","Every alert sound and every spoken warning the packs play.",1,2},{"r","Chat messages",1,2},{"d","Chat messages",1,2,"The packs' own /say, /yell and raid messages (\"Living Bomb on me\" and the like)."},{"t","Lists",1,2,"The packs' name lists - Mortal Wound List, Taunt List, Life Drain List and the rest - in every raid. Off by default; this one switch beats the per-list ticks on the raid tabs."},{"r","Lists",1,2},{"d","Lists",1,2,"The packs' name lists - Mortal Wound List, Taunt List, Life Drain List and the rest - in every raid."},{"r","The berserk (hard enrage) timer, bars and warnings for every boss.",