Raid Leader] [Thallen]: Mograine left",3,20},{"r","0[2. Trade - City] [Healbot]: LF heals",3,20},{"t","Short channel names",3,20,"\"[Party]\" reads \"[P]\", \"[Raid Leader]\" \"[RL]\", \"[Guild]\" \"[G]\", and world channels as their number (or letters). Every abbreviation is yours to change below."},{"r","Short channel names",3,20},{"d","Short channel names",3,20,"Not on this game: its chat is drawn by secure code ZacUI does not rewrite."},{"t","Colour group members' names in messages",3,20,"A name of someone in your party or raid typed inside a message takes their class colour (\"heal Thallen\"). The sender's own name is the game's, coloured as it already is."},{"r","Colour group members' names in messages",3,20},{"c","Time stamps",3,21},{"t","The game's time stamps",3,21,"The game's own setting (also under Interface > Social), written here. New lines show it. On this game it may take a /reload to show."},{"r","The game's time stamps",3,21},{"r","The game's own setting (also under Interface > Social), written here.",3,21},{"d","The game's own setting (also under Interface > Social), written here.",3,21,"Stamping every line is not on this game: its chat is drawn by secure code ZacUI does not rewrite."},{"c","Tabs on mouseover",4,22},{"r","Fade in",4,22},{"r","Stay after the mouse leaves",4,22},{"t","Stay after the mouse leaves",4,22,"When the tabs show only with the mouse over the chat. Replay in the preview (Reading) plays it."},{"r","Fade out",4,22},{"r","When the tabs show only with the mouse over the chat.",4,22},{"c","Something new",4,23},{"r","A tab with something new",4,23},{"r","Style",4,23},{"r","None",4,23},{"r","Duration",4,23},{"r","Delay",4,23},{"r","Easing",4,23},{"t","Repeat until hidden",4,23,"Pulse and Flash only: keep playing for as long as the frame is shown."},{"r","Repeat until hidden",4,23},{"r","Smooth",4,23},{"r","Comes from",4,23},{"r","Distance",4,23},{"r","Above",4,23},{"r","Its line. None keeps the slow pulse it has always had.",4,23},{"